.obsidian/

# --- MEDIA PESANTI (restano locali — GitHub limite 100MB/file) ---
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.avi
*.mkv

# --- ARCHIVI (contenuto già estratto accanto) ---
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.skill

